<title>USA: IPO FILING-Euronet Services Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING-Euronet Services Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		 Euronet Services Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			EEFT.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $12-$14/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    5.3 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 3,088,028</p>
<p>Shrs offered by shareholders  2,211,972 Shrs outstanding after ipo    13,729,560</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter		  ING BARINGS</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  795,000 shrs Business: Budapest, Hungary-based company operates  an independent, non-bank owned automatic teller machine network in Central Europe, as a service provider to banks and other financial institutions.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: A large share will be used to implement the company's strategy of expanding its independent ATM network in Hungary, Poland, Germany and other Central European markets. The balance will be used for general corporate purposes, including possible acquisitions and joint ventures consistent with its strategic goals.</p>
<p>Financial Data in 000s year ended Sept 30:</p>
<p>				   1996		 1995</p>
<p>   - Revenue		     $638		  $9</p>
<p>   - Net Income  (loss)   ($2,555)	  ($1,300)</p>
